OL,3,CFootball club condemns 'online and
OL,4,Cverbal' abuse after co-owners arrested
OL,6,FA non-league football club at the
OL,7,Fcentre of an investigation into sexual
OL,8,Fabuse and trafficking says some of its
OL,9,Fstaff have been subjected to threats
OL,10,Fand abuse.
OL,12,FMaldon and Tiptree FC was searched by
OL,13,FEssex Police after its co-owners,
OL,14,FBarrie Drewitt-Barlow, 57, and his
OL,15,Fhusband Scott, 32, were charged with
OL,16,Fmultiple offences.
OL,18,FThe men, both of Danbury, Essex, face
OL,19,Fcharges including rape, sexual
OL,20,Fassault, and modern slavery
OL,21,Ftrafficking for sexual exploitation.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
