OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1779026617
OL,3,CFootball club condemns 'online and
OL,4,Cverbal' abuse after co-owners arrested
OL,6,FIn a statement on the club's website,
OL,7,Fit said that some members of staff had
OL,8,Fsuffered "unacceptable behaviour both
OL,9,Fonline and in person."
OL,11,FThe alleged offences, which are said
OL,12,Fto have taken place in Essex and
OL,13,FManchester between April 2013 and
OL,14,FJanuary this year, relate to four
OL,15,Fdifferent men, who cannot be named for
OL,16,Flegal reasons.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
