OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1779026617
OL,3,CFootball club condemns 'online and
OL,4,Cverbal' abuse after co-owners arrested
OL,6,FBarrie Drewitt-Barlow is charged with
OL,7,Fthree counts of sexual assault on a
OL,8,Fmale, four counts of rape of a man 16
OL,9,For over, and two counts of arranging
OL,10,For facilitating travel of another
OL,11,Fperson with a view to exploitation.
OL,13,FScott Drewitt-Barlow is charged with
OL,14,Fone count of sexual assault on a male,
OL,15,Fone count of rape of a man 16 or over,
OL,16,Fand two counts of arranging or
OL,17,Ffacilitating travel of another person
OL,18,Fwith a view to exploitation.
OL,20,FTheir defence barrister said both men
OL,21,F"strenuously deny" the allegations.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
