OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1779026617
OL,3,CFootball club condemns 'online and
OL,4,Cverbal' abuse after co-owners arrested
OL,6,FIn a statement, Maldon & Tiptree
OL,7,FFootball Club said that it is "aware
OL,8,Fof the recent events and ongoing legal
OL,9,Fproceedings involving two individuals
OL,10,Fconnected to the football club."
OL,12,FA spokesperson said: "Aspen Drewitt-
OL,13,FBarlow acquired the football club on 4
OL,14,FFebruary 2025 and remains the Club's
OL,15,Fsole shareholder and controlling
OL,16,Fowner. He remains fully committed to
OL,17,Fthe continued stability, operation and
OL,18,Ffuture development of Maldon & Tiptree
OL,19,FFootball Club. The Club continues to
OL,20,Ffulfil its football, community and
OL,21,Fcommercial commitments.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1779026617
OL,3,CFootball club condemns 'online and
OL,4,Cverbal' abuse after co-owners arrested
OL,6,F"Given the nature of the allegations,
OL,7,Fthe Club expresses its sympathy
OL,8,Ftowards all victims of sexual offences
OL,9,Fand recognises the seriousness and
OL,10,Fsensitivity of matters of this kind.
OL,11,FAt the same time, it is important to
OL,12,Fnote that criminal proceedings are
OL,13,Fongoing and the legal process must be
OL,14,Fallowed to proceed fairly and properly.
OL,16,F"The Club, its ownership, players,
OL,17,Fstaff, volunteers, supporters and
OL,18,Fsponsors should not be subjected to
OL,19,Fabuse, threats or harassment in
OL,20,Frelation to matters unconnected to
OL,21,Fthem.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,317,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1779026617
OL,3,CFootball club condemns 'online and
OL,4,Cverbal' abuse after co-owners arrested
OL,6,F"In recent days, some members of staff
OL,7,Fhave experienced unacceptable
OL,8,Fbehaviour both online and in person,
OL,9,Fand the Club respectfully asks that
OL,10,Fthis behaviour ceases immediately.
OL,12,F"As proceedings remain ongoing, it
OL,13,Fwould be inappropriate for the Club to
OL,14,Fcomment further at this stage. The
OL,15,FClub recognises that all individuals
OL,16,Fare entitled to a fair legal process.
OL,18,F"Maldon & Tiptree Football Club
OL,19,Fremains fully focused on continuing
OL,20,Fits positive progress both on and off
OL,21,Fthe pitch."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
